   "duration_sec": 8.515
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C64-D003",
   "turn_index": 2,
   "speaker": "ハサン",
   "source_text": "では、元のチラシと林さんの修正案を比べましょう。元のチラシは表の金ピカのエンブレムが目立ちますが、写真にある細長い幟の字は小さいですね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C64-D003-S01",
    "C64-D003-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 16.561,
   "end_sec": 28.712,
   "duration_sec": 12.151
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C64-D004",
   "turn_index": 3,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "読みやすさから言えば、修正案の裏は元のチラシよりいいですね。角形の枠で利用条件を囲んでいます。丸形のマークは何ですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C64-D004-S01",
    "C64-D004-S02",
    "C64-D004-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 29.062,
   "end_sec": 38.876,
   "duration_sec": 9.814
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C64-D005",
   "turn_index": 4,
   "speaker": "ハサン",
   "source_text": "おすすめの本を示す赤丸です。紅白の色だけでも十分目立ちますね。でも、条件の枠より大きいのは困ります。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C64-D005-S01",
    "C64-D005-S02",
    "C64-D005-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 39.226,
   "end_sec": 48.066,
   "duration_sec": 8.84
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C64-D006",
   "turn_index": 5,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "本当ですね。大型の写真より、小さくても情報が読める写真を選びましょう。人のルックスだけで写真を選ぶのも変です。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C64-D006-S01",
    "C64-D006-S02",
    "C64-D006-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 48.416,
   "end_sec": 58.377,
   "duration_sec": 9.961
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C64-D007",
   "turn_index": 6,
   "speaker": "ハサン",
   "source_text": "修正案に使う写真の候補ですね。このモデルはクールな表情ですね。髪型もかっこいい。でも、隣の後姿の写真では、借り方が分かりません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C64-D007-S01",
    "C64-D007-S02",
    "C64-D007-S03",
    "C64-D007-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
