   "end_sec": 70.152,
   "duration_sec": 11.425
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C64-D008",
   "turn_index": 7,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "写真にかけては、同僚の森さんが詳しいです。森さんに言わせれば、和風か洋風かより、何を伝えるかが大事だそうです。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C64-D008-S01",
    "C64-D008-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 70.502,
   "end_sec": 81.307,
   "duration_sec": 10.805
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C64-D009",
   "turn_index": 8,
   "speaker": "ハサン",
   "source_text": "おしゃれなスタイルもいいですが、もう一枚の候補も、この大柄の布が背景だと、本より布に目が行きますね。図書館の静かな雰囲気を描くほうがよさそうです。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C64-D009-S01",
    "C64-D009-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 81.657,
   "end_sec": 94.132,
   "duration_sec": 12.475
  },
  {
